wave[kind_,t_]:=With[{phase=Mod[1000 t,1]},Switch[kind,"sine",.5 Sin[2 Pi phase],"triangle",.5(1-4 Abs[phase-.5]),_,If[phase<.5,.5,-.5]]];
compute[dir_]:=Module[{cfg,rows,liss,metrics=<||>,tables,series=<||>,volrows={},timerows={},inferred={},lissrows={},k,label,upp,up,rms,meter,tt,freq,deviation,ts,fx,nx,ny,fy,kv,y,kt,x,f0},
 cfg=Import[FileNameJoin[{dir,"experiment.json"}],"RawJSON"];rows=Rest[Import[FileNameJoin[{dir,"data","waveforms.csv"}],"CSV"]];liss=Rest[Import[FileNameJoin[{dir,"data","lissajous.csv"}],"CSV"]];
 Do[{k,label,kv,y,meter,kt,x,f0}=row;upp=N[kv y];up=upp/2;rms=up/Switch[k,"sine",Sqrt[2],"triangle",Sqrt[3],_,1];tt=N[kt x/1000];freq=1/tt;deviation=100(meter-rms)/rms;
 MapThread[AssociateTo[metrics,k<>"_"<>#1-><|"value"->N[#2],"unit"->#3,"label"->label<>" "<>#4|>]&,
 {{"U_pp","U_peak","U_rms","meter_deviation_percent","period","frequency"},{upp,up,rms,deviation,tt,freq},{"V","V","V","%","s","Hz"},{"\:5cf0\:5cf0\:503c","\:5cf0\:503c","\:51e0\:4f55\:6ce2\:5f62\:6709\:6548\:503c","\:6beb\:4f0f\:8868\:4e0e\:6ce2\:5f62\:6709\:6548\:503c\:504f\:5dee","\:5468\:671f","\:5468\:671f\:6cd5\:9891\:7387"}}];
 AppendTo[volrows,{label,kv,y,upp,cfg["source_rms"][k],Round[rms,.000001],meter,Round[deviation,.001]}];AppendTo[timerows,{label,kt,x,tt,freq,f0}];ts=N[Range[0,1000]2*10^-6];AssociateTo[series,k<>"_wave"-><|"x"->ts 1000,"y"->(wave[k,#]&/@ts),"x_label"->"\:65f6\:95f4 $t\\,/\\,\\mathrm{ms}$","y_label"->"\:7535\:538b $u\\,/\\,\\mathrm{V}$","label"->"\:7406\:60f3"<>label<>"\:ff08\:793a\:610f\:ff09","model"->True|>],{row,rows}];
 Do[{fx,nx,ny}=liss[[j]];fy=N[fx nx/ny];AppendTo[inferred,fy];AppendTo[lissrows,{fx,nx,ny,fy}];AssociateTo[metrics,"lissajous_"<>ToString[j]<>"_frequency"-><|"value"->fy,"unit"->"Hz","label"->"\:674e\:8428\:5982\:7b2c"<>ToString[j]<>"\:7ec4\:9891\:7387"|>];ts=N[Range[0,1000]4*10^-6];AssociateTo[series,"lissajous_"<>ToString[j]-><|"x"->Sin[2 Pi fx ts],"y"->Sin[2 Pi fy ts+Pi/4],"x_label"->"\:5f52\:4e00\:5316\:6c34\:5e73\:7535\:538b $u_x/A_x$","y_label"->"\:5f52\:4e00\:5316\:5782\:76f4\:7535\:538b $u_y/A_y$","label"->"\:7406\:60f3\:9891\:7387\:6bd4\:4e0e\:76f8\:4f4d\:03c0/4","model"->True,"equal_aspect"->True|>],{j,Length[liss]}];
 AssociateTo[metrics,"lissajous_mean_frequency"-><|"value"->Mean[inferred],"unit"->"Hz","label"->"\:674e\:8428\:5982\:9891\:7387\:5747\:503c"|>];
 tables=<|"voltage"-><|"headers"->{"\:6ce2\:5f62","$k_V/(\\mathrm{V/div})$","$y/\\mathrm{div}$","$U_{pp}/\\mathrm{V}$","\:6e90\:6709\:6548\:503c / V","\:91cd\:7b97\:6709\:6548\:503c / V","\:6beb\:4f0f\:8868 / V","\:76f8\:5bf9\:91cd\:7b97\:503c\:504f\:5dee / %"},"rows"->volrows|>,"period"-><|"headers"->{"\:6ce2\:5f62","\:626b\:63cf / (ms/div)","\:6c34\:5e73\:957f\:5ea6 / div","\:5468\:671f / s","\:91cd\:7b97\:9891\:7387 / Hz","\:4fe1\:53f7\:6e90 / Hz"},"rows"->timerows|>,"lissajous"-><|"headers"->{"\:6807\:51c6\:9891\:7387 / Hz","$N_x$","$N_y$","\:91cd\:7b97\:9891\:7387 / Hz"},"rows"->lissrows|>|>;
 <|"metrics"->metrics,"tables"->tables,"series"->series,"notes"->{"\:6e90\:6b63\:5f26\:6709\:6548\:503c0.5V\:4e3a\:5904\:7406\:9519\:8bef\:ff0c\:539f\:51e0\:4f55\:8bfb\:6570\:4e0d\:53d8\:3002","\:674e\:8428\:5982\:6a21\:62df\:76f8\:4f4d\:03c0/4\:4e3a\:5c55\:793a\:53c2\:6570\:ff0c\:975e\:622a\:56fe\:76f8\:4f4d\:6d4b\:91cf\:3002","\:7f3a\:5c11\:8bfb\:683c\:548c\:4eea\:5668\:9650\:5dee\:ff0c\:672a\:628a\:8bfb\:6570\:543b\:5408\:8868\:8ff0\:4e3a\:7cbe\:786e\:9891\:7387\:771f\:503c\:3002"}|>];

explore["waveforms",r_]:=Manipulate[Plot[wave[k,t],{t,0,.002},PlotStyle->Black,Exclusions->If[k=="square",Table[j/2000,{j,0,4}],None],Frame->{{True,False},{True,False}},Axes->False,FrameLabel->{styled["\:65f6\:95f4 t / s"],styled["\:7535\:538b u / V"]},ImageSize->950,BaseStyle->{FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->16}],{{k,"sine",styled["\:7406\:60f3\:6ce2\:5f62"]},{"sine"->Pane[styled["\:6b63\:5f26"],{70,24}],"triangle"->Pane[styled["\:4e09\:89d2"],{70,24}],"square"->Pane[styled["\:65b9\:6ce2"],{70,24}]}},SaveDefinitions->True];
explore["lissajous",r_]:=Manipulate[ParametricPlot[{Sin[2 Pi fx t],Sin[2 Pi 1000 t+phase]},{t,0,.004},PlotStyle->Black,AspectRatio->1,Frame->{{True,False},{True,False}},Axes->False,FrameLabel->{styled["\:5f52\:4e00\:5316\:6c34\:5e73\:7535\:538b ux / Ax"],styled["\:5f52\:4e00\:5316\:5782\:76f4\:7535\:538b uy / Ay"]},ImageSize->650,BaseStyle->{FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->16}],{{fx,250,styled["\:6807\:51c6\:9891\:7387 / Hz"]},{250->Pane[Style["250",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{64,24},Alignment->Center],500->Pane[Style["500",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{64,24},Alignment->Center],1000->Pane[Style["1000",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{64,24},Alignment->Center],1500->Pane[Style["1500",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{64,24},Alignment->Center],2000->Pane[Style["2000",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{64,24},Alignment->Center]},ControlType->SetterBar},{{phase,Pi/4,styled["\:6a21\:578b\:76f8\:4f4d"]},{0->Pane[Style["0",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{52,24},Alignment->Center],Pi/4->Pane[Style["\:03c0/4",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{52,24},Alignment->Center],Pi/2->Pane[Style["\:03c0/2",FontFamily->"Times New Roman",FontSize->14],{52,24},Alignment->Center]},ControlType->SetterBar},SaveDefinitions->True];
